'''Spencer Mason Hawes''' (born April 28, 1988) is a former professional American [[basketball]] player. A [[Center (basketball)|center]], he was selected by the [[Sacramento Kings]] in the [[2007 NBA draft]] and is the nephew of [[Steve Hawes]], a retired NBA player.<ref>[http://www.nba.com/draft2007/profiles/SpencerHawes.html NBA.com: 2007 NBA Draft Board-Spencer Hawes]</ref>

